desc.en:
In my day, we didn't need these Scoutflies to track down monsters,
but this is the New World... I've located some interesting monsters
for you. Go get them. (Bonus HR points rewarded upon completion.)

Some roaming Banbaro have adapted to the Wildspire and are
using mounds of mud to attack hunters! Careful out there,
everyone! (Bonus HR/MR points rewarded upon completion.)

It's so freakin' cold out here that I came up with a design
for some warm armor based on a monster! It looks strong,
yes, strong indeed! (Special material rewards)
